<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hartford Financial featured.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hartford Financial featured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>CS First Boston said on Monday it named Hartford Financial Services Group Inc its featured stock of the week.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 82-1/4.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
